<title>NETHERLANDS: ICT SHARES START TRADING AT NLG 28.00.</title>
<headline>ICT SHARES START TRADING AT NLG 28.00.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1997-06-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in software services firm ICT Automatisering NV started trading at 28.00 guilders on the Amsterdam Exchanges on Thursday.</p>
<p>Earlier the firm reported the initial public offering of ICT shares had been priced at 26.00 guilders per share.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000</p>
</text>
